#: agents/apps.py:11
msgid "Agents"
msgstr "Agents"

#: agents/replies.py:25
msgid ""
"This service only answers questions about Islam. Please ask a question about "
"Islam."
msgstr ""
"Ce service répond uniquement aux questions sur l’islam. Veuillez poser une "
"question sur l’islam."

#: agents/replies.py:27
msgid ""
"Your question needs a specialist. It has been referred to a center of "
"specialists, who will answer you."
msgstr ""
"Votre question nécessite un spécialiste. Elle a été transmise à un centre de "
"spécialistes, qui vous répondra."

#: agents/replies.py:29
msgid ""
"We could not find an answer to this question in our sources. Please rephrase "
"it or ask a center of specialists."
msgstr ""
"Nous n’avons pas trouvé de réponse à cette question dans nos sources. "
"Veuillez la reformuler ou interroger un centre de spécialistes."

#: agents/replies.py:31
msgid "Note: our sources answer this question only in part."
msgstr "Remarque : nos sources ne répondent qu’en partie à cette question."

#: agents/replies.py:32
msgid ""
"This matter involves scholarly disagreement; consult a specialist for your "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"Cette question fait l’objet de divergences entre savants ; consultez un "
"spécialiste pour votre situation."

#: agents/replies.py:34
msgid ""
"The service has reached its limit of questions for today. Please try again "
"tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Le service a atteint sa limite de questions pour aujourd’hui. Veuillez "
"réessayer demain."

